When you're there in person, something feels, like, eerie something extra.
当你亲自去到那里时，总觉得有什么东西怪异得有些过分。

145
00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:52.960
It feels like this doesn't look like it should belong here.
感觉这东西看起来就不应该属于这里。

146
00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:54.540
I gotta go.
我得去看看。

147
00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.220
It feels really old.
感觉真的很古老。

148
