It's bald eagle season in northern Utah!
犹他州北部迎来白头鹰季了！

744
00:29:32.110 --> 00:29:33.250
Exclamation point!
感叹号！

745
00:29:33.510 --> 00:29:38.310
Bald eagles migrate from the mountains and from colder northern regions, and one of them
白头鹰从山区和更寒冷的北方地区迁徙而来，其中一只

