00:29:38.310 --> 00:29:40.690
comes to my little neighborhood every year.
每年都会来到我的小社区。

747
00:29:40.930 --> 00:29:46.710
During January and February, we see him flying around the pond, perched on phone lines, and
在一月和二月，我们看到它在池塘周围飞翔，栖息在电话线上，

748
00:29:46.710 --> 00:29:48.110
