00:30:43.910 --> 00:30:50.150
I was part of a live podcast recording event in my neighborhood of West Philly, in quotes,
我参加了我所在的西费城社区的一场现场播客录制活动，用引号来说，

778
00:30:50.470 --> 00:30:53.930
