I'm proud that my little neighborhood has this much interesting culture and art going on.
我很骄傲我的小社区有这么多有趣的文化和艺术活动。

785
00:31:15.590 --> 00:31:16.530
I love that.
我太喜欢这个了。

786
00:31:16.690 --> 00:31:18.930
And Jenna, you were in Fiddler on the Roof.
珍娜，你演过《屋顶上的提琴手》哎。

787
00:31:19.170 --> 00:31:23.630
Lady, I was the fiddler in Fiddler on the Roof.
天哪，我就是《屋顶上的提琴手》里拉提琴的那个人。

